---
layout: base.njk
title: Start
description: Ein Blog über Context Engineering, Wissensaufbau und Werkzeuge für technisch versierte Menschen.
pagination:
  data: collections.posts
  size: 6
  alias: paginatedPosts
permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/{% else %}/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}Start{% else %}Start · Seite {{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}{% endif %}"
---
{% set latest = collections.posts[0] %}
{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}
<section class="hero shell">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Context Engineering / Knowledge Work / Agentic Systems</p>
    <h1>agentsbl0g sammelt Wissen für Menschen, die mit Kontext arbeiten.</h1>
    <p>Ein technischer Blog über Context Engineering, Agentic Development, Wissensaufbau und die Werkzeuge, mit denen aus verstreuten Quellen belastbare Systeme entstehen.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="{{ '/archive/' | url(site.url) }}">Alle Beiträge</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="{{ '/feed.xml' | url(site.url) }}">RSS Feed</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="status-panel" aria-label="Site status">
    <span>context</span>
    <strong>Context Engineering</strong>
    <span>knowledge</span>
    <strong>Wissensaufbau</strong>
    <span>systems</span>
    <strong>Agentic Development</strong>
  </aside>
</section>

{% if latest %}
<section class="featured shell" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Latest</p>
    <h2 id="featured-title"><a href="{{ latest.url | url(site.url) }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ latest.data.description }}</p>
  </div>
  <time datetime="{{ latest.date | htmlDate }}">{{ latest.date | readableDate }}</time>
</section>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

<section class="shell section" aria-labelledby="recent-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="recent-title" class="ansi-section-heading">
      <span class="sr-only">Aktuelle Einträge{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %} · Seite {{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="ansi-section-title" aria-hidden="true">▄▀▀▀▄ ▄   ▄ █    ▄   ▄  ▄▄▄  ▄  ▄   ▄▄▄     █▀▀▀▀ ▀    ▄▄  █    ▄ ▄▄  ▄▄▄   ▄▄▄   ▄▄▄▄  ▄▄▄
█   █ █ ▄▀  █▀▀▀ █   █ █▄▄▄█ █  █  █▄▄▄█    █▄▄▄ ▀█  █▀  █ █▀▀▀ █▀    ▄▄▄█ █▄▄▄█ █   █ █▄▄▄█
█▀▀▀█ █▀▀▄  █    █  ▄█ █     █  █  █        █     █  █   █ █    █    █   █ █     ▀▄▄▄█ █
▀   ▀ ▀   ▀  ▀▀▀  ▀▀ ▀  ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀ ▀▀ ▀▀▀▀    ▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀ ▀   ▀  ▀▀▀ ▀     ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀  ▄▄▄▀  ▀▀▀▀</span>
      {% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}
        <span class="ansi-section-kicker" aria-hidden="true">/ Seite {{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </h2>
    <span class="section-count">{{ collections.posts.length }} Beiträge</span>
  </div>
  <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in paginatedPosts %}
      {% include "post-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% if pagination.pages.length > 1 %}
    <nav class="pagination" aria-label="Seitennavigation für aktuelle Einträge">
      {% if pagination.href.previous %}
        <a href="{{ pagination.href.previous | url(site.url) }}">Neuere</a>
      {% else %}
        <span aria-disabled="true">Neuere</span>
      {% endif %}

      <ol>
        {% for href in pagination.hrefs %}
          <li>
            <a href="{{ href | url(site.url) }}"{% if page.url == href %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ loop.index }}</a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>

      {% if pagination.href.next %}
        <a href="{{ pagination.href.next | url(site.url) }}">Ältere</a>
      {% else %}
        <span aria-disabled="true">Ältere</span>
      {% endif %}
    </nav>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}
<section class="shell section" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="topics-title" class="ansi-section-heading">
      <span class="sr-only">Topics</span>
      <span class="ansi-section-title ansi-section-title-small" aria-hidden="true">▀▀█▀▀  ▄▄▄  ▄▄▄▄   ▀   ▄▄▄   ▄▄▄
  █   █   █ █   █ ▀█  █   ▀ ▀▄▄▄
  █   █   █ █▄▄▄▀  █  █     ▄   █
  ▀    ▀▀▀  █     ▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀</span>
    </h2>
    <a href="{{ '/tags/' | url(site.url) }}">Alle Tags</a>
  </div>
  <div class="topic-cloud">
    {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
      <a href="{{ ('/tags/' ~ (tag | slugify) ~ '/') | url(site.url) }}">#{{ tag }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
